module stratachangeset

; Changes with indexed structure.
;
; This layer adds no primitive and widens nothing. The change calculus and
; its normalization are Strata's own -- `strata/system/changeset.strata` --
; and the only thing Meta contributes is the source list the checks link.

judgment StrataChangeSetSystem [prelude native octets artifact collections changeset] =
  list [prelude native octets artifact collections changeset]
